></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">With <a href=\"#/wiki/Oil\">Oil</a>.</li><li id=\"w-notes-2\">With <a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20%28Liquid%29\">Water</a>.</li></ol></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Nezil.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi nezil</b><br/>\nNezil: Hiho <i>Player</i>, Nezil at your service. We sell equipment of all kinds.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>equipment</b><br/>\nNezil: As you can see, we offer quite a lot of stuff, such as torches, shovels and the like. Ask me for a trade to have a look.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Bezil</b><br/>\nNezil: She's my sis'.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nNezil: We sell equipment of all kinds. If there's anything you need, ask me for a trade.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nNezil: I'm Nezil Whetstone, son of Fire of the Savage Axes. I and my sis' Bezil are selling stuff, ye' know?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>time</b><br/>\nNezil: I think it's about 8:57 pm. If you bought a watch, you'd know for sure.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>poem</b><br/>\nNezil: I was thinking about a poem as a slogan for my shop but it's not ready for a big audience, yet.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nNezil: Good bye, <i>Player</i>.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Nezil</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[],"pos":{"x":32661,"y":31912,"z":9}}